# CR 508.1d/508.1h-j: ai's Propaganda ("creatures can't attack you unless
# their controller pays {2} for each creature they control that's attacking
# you", Mode$ CantAttackUnless) taxes human's Silvercoat Lion. Human floats
# {W}{W} in the declare attackers step, declares the Lion, agrees to pay
# (ConfirmPayCost, the same question an UnlessCost$ asks) and pays both
# generic units from the pool (CombatUtil.checkPropagandaEffects,
# PhaseHandler.java:576-597). The Lion attacks, tapped, and deals 2.
startturn human
advance 5
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
queue attackers 1
queue confirmpaycost true
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
